graph TD
    subgraph "model-metadata-collection RBAC"
        direction TB

        Note["No RBAC Defined"]
        Description["This component has no Kubernetes RBAC<br/>resources (ClusterRoles, RoleBindings,<br/>or ServiceAccounts) defined in its repository.<br/><br/>The data sidecar container runs as<br/>UID 1001 (non-root) and requires<br/>no Kubernetes API access.<br/><br/>Deployment and RBAC are managed externally<br/>by the platform operator."]

        Note --- Description
